Three suggestions:
Upgrade to rmr 1.2 so that we can focus our effort on one version
Post a reproducible example with data and everything. If I can reproduce it with my setup, you are guaranteed I am going to try and debug it. Otherwise I can just give you some ideas on what can be going on. This suggestions implies number 1 (I have 1.2 installed, as you can imagine)
Check the userlogs, not the syslogs. The syslogs might tell you about bugs in Hadoop, but not rmr or your own code
I hope this helps

A

